---
import { SITE, WHATSAPP_NUMBER } from "../config/site";
import { buildConsultaGeneralLink } from "../lib/whatsapp";

const waLink = buildConsultaGeneralLink(WHATSAPP_NUMBER);
const anio = new Date().getFullYear();
const numeroLegible = `${WHATSAPP_NUMBER.slice(0, 2)} ${WHATSAPP_NUMBER.slice(2, 3)} ${WHATSAPP_NUMBER.slice(3, 5)} ${WHATSAPP_NUMBER.slice(5, 9)}-${WHATSAPP_NUMBER.slice(9)}`;
---

<footer class="bg-ink">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[90rem] gap-10 px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 md:grid-cols-3">
    <div>
      <a href="/" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <span class="relative h-7 w-7 sm:h-8 sm:w-8">
          <img src="/icon-white.png" alt="" width="30" height="30" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-0" />
          <img src="/icon-gold.png" alt="" width="30" height="30" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100" />
        </span>
        <span class="font-display text-xl text-canvas transition-colors group-hover:text-gold">{SITE.nombre}</span>
      </a>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-xs font-body text-sm text-canvas/65">
        Un negocio familiar: siempre te atiende la misma familia, de principio a
        fin de tu estadía en Recoleta, Palermo y Balvanera.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="font-body text-sm font-semibold text-canvas">Contacto</p>
      <a href={waLink} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-ubicacion="footer" class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 font-body text-sm text-canvas/65 hover:text-gold">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 fill-current" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M13.601 2.326A7.85 7.85 0 0 0 7.994 0C3.627 0 .068 3.558.064 7.926c0 1.399.366 2.76 1.057 3.965L0 16l4.204-1.102a7.9 7.9 0 0 0 3.79.965h.004c4.368 0 7.926-3.558 7.93-7.93A7.9 7.9 0 0 0 13.6 2.326zM7.994 14.521a6.6 6.6 0 0 1-3.356-.92l-.24-.144-2.494.654.666-2.433-.156-.251a6.56 6.56 0 0 1-1.007-3.505c0-3.626 2.957-6.584 6.591-6.584a6.56 6.56 0 0 1 4.66 1.931 6.56 6.56 0 0 1 1.928 4.66c-.004 3.639-2.961 6.592-6.592 6.592m3.615-4.934c-.197-.099-1.17-.578-1.353-.646-.182-.065-.315-.099-.445.099-.133.197-.513.646-.627.775-.114.133-.232.148-.43.05-.197-.1-.836-.308-1.592-.985-.59-.525-.985-1.175-1.103-1.372-.114-.198-.011-.304.088-.403.087-.088.197-.232.296-.346.1-.114.133-.198.198-.33.065-.134.034-.248-.015-.347-.05-.099-.445-1.076-.612-1.47-.16-.389-.323-.335-.445-.34-.114-.005-.247-.005-.38-.005a.73.73 0 0 0-.529.247c-.182.198-.691.677-.691 1.654 0 .977.71 1.916.81 2.049.098.133 1.394 2.132 3.383 2.99.47.205.84.326 1.129.418.475.152.904.129 1.246.08.38-.058 1.171-.48 1.337-.943.164-.464.164-.86.114-.943-.049-.084-.182-.133-.38-.232" />
        </svg>
        {numeroLegible}
      </a>
      <a href="/departamentos" class="mt-2 block font-body text-sm text-canvas/65 hover:text-gold">
        Ver departamentos
      </a>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="font-body text-sm font-semibold text-canvas">Diferenciales</p>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 font-body text-sm text-canvas/65">
        <li>Sin seña, abonás al ingresar</li>
        <li>Descuento pagando en efectivo</li>
        <li>Reubicación asegurada ante una emergencia</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="border-t border-canvas/15">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-[90rem] flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 px-4 py-5 font-body text-xs text-canvas/50 sm:px-6">
      <p>© {anio} {SITE.nombre}. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
      <p>
        <a href="/privacidad" class="hover:text-gold">Privacidad</a>
      </p>
      <p>
        Sitio realizado por{" "}
        <a
          href="https://deploystudio.com.ar/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="font-bold text-canvas/70 transition-colors hover:text-gold"
        >
          /deploy_
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
